     $$ \phi(Y) = \sum_i \left\| \mathbf{Y}_i - \sum_j W_{ij} \mathbf{Y}_j \right\|^2 $$
     This minimization is solved by finding the $d$ lowest non-zero eigenvectors of the matrix $(I - W)^T (I - W)$, where $I$ is the identity matrix [S1].
